<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Newfield initiated as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Newfield initiated as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--ABN Amro Chicago Corp said Friday it initiated coverage of Newfield Exploration Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--The oil and gas exploration company has maintained one of the lowest operating unit costs among its peers, despite its constantly rising levels of production coupled with high gas price realizations, ABN Amro Chicago Corp said in a report.</p>
<p>--The firm's earnings per share estimates for Newfield are $1.07 in 1997 and $1.15 in 1998.</p>
<p>--Newfield Exploration ended off 5/8 at 18-3/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
